name phfqit
category Package
revision 60734
shortdesc Macros for typesetting Quantum Information Theory
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides macros to typeset some general
longdesc mathematical operators (identity operator, trace, diagonal,
longdesc rank, ...), a powerful implementation of the bra-ket notation
longdesc (kets, bras, brakets, matrix elements etc. which can be sized
longdesc as required), delimited expressions such as averages and norms,
longdesc and some basic Lie algebra/group names. Macros for entropy
longdesc measures for quantum information theory (smooth min- and
longdesc max-entropy, smooth relative entropies, etc.) are also
longdesc provided.
runfiles size=5
 RELOC/tex/latex/phfqit/phfqit.sty
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/phfaist/phfqitltx
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/phfqit
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths physics
catalogue-version 4.1
